r"""
LATRICS Operations Suite
========================
One window for every LATRICS tool.  Pick a tool in the left sidebar.

    CHECKS               GNSS Pre-Check          RINEX base + rover quality check, Word report
                         Data Pre-Check          images / events / GCP checks, Word report
    PHOTO PROCESSING     Image Enhancer          fix dark / over-exposed / blurry images into a new folder
                         Event Generation        KQ .dat -> PPK -> Pos_Camera.txt (many flights)
                         Geotag Pipeline         Septentrio SBF + base -> PPK -> geotagged images
                         Ortho Launcher          Metashape network ortho pipeline
    LIDAR PROCESSING     LiDAR Tool              POS, strips, PointsCreator .lip, Start Calc

Every tool is embedded UNCHANGED (its own code, its own processing).  This file only provides the
window, the sidebar and the dashboard.

Run:    python latrics_suite.py                 (opens the dashboard)
        python latrics_suite.py --page lidar    (opens straight to one tool:
                                                 gnss | data | enhancer | events | geotag | ortho | lidar)
Needs:  Python 3.8+ with tkinter.   Each tool lists its own packages on the Dashboard
        (numpy, matplotlib, python-docx, pillow, piexif, openpyxl, pywinauto, ...)
        and the Dashboard can install the missing ones for you.
Settings files of the tools are saved next to this file.
"""
